# FENNEC FOUNTAIN: a block pushed into a 1 that can't move takes it in and
# weighs one more (Block Koala's manual: a 2 pushed into a dot against a
# wall makes a 3; two dots make a 2). A 1 that can move is simply pushed.
# A block that reaches 5 turns to marble, which never changes again.
game fennec
wait 5
# the 1 can move: it is pushed along
cheat setroom #########/#K.31...#/#########
press RIGHT
wait 12
press RIGHT
wait 12
expect tile41 == 13
expect tile51 == 11
# against a wall: 3 + 1 = 4, and the 3 lands where the 1 was
cheat setroom ######/#K.31#/######
press RIGHT
wait 12
press RIGHT
wait 12
expect tile41 == 14
expect tile31 == 0
expect nb == 1
expect px == 3
# two dots make a 2
cheat setroom ######/#K.11#/######
press RIGHT
wait 12
press RIGHT
wait 12
expect tile41 == 12
expect nb == 1
# a 1 pushed into a heavier block is stuck; they don't merge
cheat setroom #########/#K.13...#/#########
press RIGHT
wait 12
press RIGHT
wait 12
expect px == 2
expect tile31 == 11
expect tile41 == 13
expect nb == 2
# four and one: five turns to marble
cheat setroom ######/#K.41#/######
press RIGHT
wait 12
press RIGHT
wait 12
expect tile41 == 55
# marble pushes anything, but never takes in a 1
cheat setroom #########/#K.54...#/#########
press RIGHT
wait 12
press RIGHT
wait 12
expect tile41 == 55
expect tile51 == 14
cheat setroom ######/#K.51#/######
press RIGHT
wait 12
press RIGHT
wait 12
expect px == 2
expect tile31 == 55
expect tile41 == 11
# the water stone weighs nothing: it can't push a 1
cheat setroom #########/#K.S1...#/#########
press RIGHT
wait 12
press RIGHT
wait 12
expect px == 2
expect tile31 == 40
